# Frontend API Integration

## Single HTTP layer

- All backend calls go through `src/services/api.jsx` (`apiClient` + exported `*Service` objects).
- Do **not** add Axios/fetch in pages or components.
- JWT: already attached via request interceptor; 401/403 clears auth and redirects to `/login`.

## Base URL

- Dev: `http://localhost:8080/api` (matches backend; Vite proxy is optional).
- When adding env support later, change only `apiClient` baseURL — not per call site.

## Response contract

Backend wraps data in:

```json
{ "success": true, "data": { ... }, "message": "..." }
```

- Service methods return `response.data` (the full envelope).
- Pages/hooks check `response.success` then use `response.data`.
- Surface errors from `error.response?.data?.message` or a generic Vietnamese fallback.

```jsx
// ✅ Pattern (match History.jsx)
const response = await userService.getPracticeHistory();
if (response.success) setItems(response.data ?? []);
```

## Service modules (extend, don't scatter)

| Export | Use for |
|--------|---------|
| `authService` | login, register |
| `userService` | practice history, session detail, profile |
| `speakingService` | topics, questions by topic (learner practice) |
| `adminService` | admin CRUD only |

Add **`assessmentService`** for `/user/assessment/*` when building level test — do not overload `speakingService`.

Naming: `getX`, `createX`, `updateX`; async functions return envelope from `response.data`.

## Backend field names (critical)

Use API shapes, not legacy mock names:

| Backend | Not |
|---------|-----|
| `topicId` | `id` |
| `topicName` | `title` |
| `questionId` | `id` |
| `description` | `text` (question prompt) |
| `difficultyLevel` | `level` |
| `overallScore` / feedback fields | hardcoded random score |

**Questions by topic:** `GET /topics/{topicId}/questions` — not `/sentences`.

## Learner endpoints (reference)

| Feature | Method | Path |
|---------|--------|------|
| Topics list | GET | `/topics` |
| Questions | GET | `/topics/:topicId/questions` |
| Practice history | GET | `/user/practice/history` |
| Session detail | GET | `/user/practice/session/:sessionId` |
| Assessment start | POST | `/user/assessment/start` |
| Assessment commit | POST | `/user/assessment/commit` |
| Assessment history | GET | `/user/assessment/history` |
| Profile | GET/PUT | `/profile/:id` (verify backend before wiring) |

Align `userService.getProfile` with actual backend path when implementing profile.

## Hooks pattern

Extract when a page needs loading + error + data:

```jsx
// src/hooks/useTopics.js
export function useTopics() {
  const [topics, setTopics] = useState([]);
  const [isLoading, setIsLoading] = useState(true);
  const [error, setError] = useState(null);
  // call speakingService.getTopics() in useEffect
  return { topics, isLoading, error, refetch };
}
```

Pages: `const { topics, isLoading, error } = useTopics();` — no raw `useEffect` + service in every page.

## Cleanup

- Remove unused `mockData` imports from `api.jsx` when touching that file.
- Do not add `console.log` for successful responses in new code.
